WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.375
The magic of

00:00:01.187 --> 00:00:02.625
partial evaluation

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.810
One of these

00:00:03.622 --> 00:00:05.060
incredibly beautiful

00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:06.168
